viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Mission Directive</span></div><p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 md:text-lg\">Je suis passionné par l&#x27;interconnexion entre le monde physique de l&#x27;industrie et l&#x27;univers numérique de l&#x27;informatique. Mon objectif est de<!-- --> <strong class=\"text-zinc-900 dark:text-white\">concevoir des systèmes intelligents, résilients et optimisés</strong> <!-- -->qui répondent aux défis de l&#x27;Industrie 4.0. De la programmation bas niveau (C/C++) à la conception d&#x27;architectures logicielles, j&#x27;aime résoudre des problèmes complexes pour faire interagir les machines et les données.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] p-4 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Base Opérationnelle</span></div><span class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Lille / Dunkerque, FR</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] p-4 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Statut Actuel</span></div><span class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Ingénieur Apprenti</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] p-4 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Spécialisation</span></div><span class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Automatisme &amp; Informatique Industrielle / Robotique</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] p-4 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02]\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-crosshair h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"18\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"2\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest\">Objectif</span></div><span class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Ingénierie R&amp;D / Tech Lead</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"relative h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-blue/50 to-transparent dark:via-brand-blue/30\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-[150px] bg-brand-blue blur-[2px]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[4px] w-[50px] bg-white blur-[4px] dark:bg-brand-blue/80\"></div></div><section id=\"academic\" class=\"relative w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto py-32 px-4 sm:px-8 overflow-hidden z-10 scroll-mt-32\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex w-full flex-col items-start border-b border-black/10 pb-6 dark:border-white/10 lg:mb-20\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\">System.Process.Monitor</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Parcours Académique</h2><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">&gt; Extraction des données de formation initiale et avancée...</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-[2px] -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none z-0\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-32 md:gap-40\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 w-full md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-16 sm:pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-right\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)\"><h3 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-black text-transparent outline-none tracking-tighter\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px currentColor;color:transparent\"><span class=\"text-zinc-900/20 dark:text-white/20 select-none\">2025</span><span class=\"block text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-600 sm:inline-block sm:ml-4\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:0px\">- <!-- -->2028</span></h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-brand-blue shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(138,180,248,0.6)] -translate-x-1/2 mt-2 md:mt-0 dark:bg-[#050505]\" style=\"transform:scale(0)\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-left\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)\"><h4 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight\">Cycle Ingénieur - Génie Électrique et Mécatronique</h4><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue tracking-widest uppercase mb-6\">Polytech Lille</p><p class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg max-w-lg\">Formation d&#x27;ingénierie avancée en génie électrique et mécatronique, spécialisation Automatisme &amp; Informatique Industrielle / Robotique. Automatisme, électronique, traitement du signal et programmation C/C++ et Python. En alternance.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 w-full md:flex-row-reverse\"><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-16 sm:pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-left\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)\"><h3 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-black text-transparent outline-none tracking-tighter\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px currentColor;color:transparent\"><span class=\"text-zinc-900/20 dark:text-white/20 select-none\">2023</span><span class=\"block text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-600 sm:inline-block sm:ml-4\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:0px\">- <!-- -->2025</span></h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-brand-blue shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(138,180,248,0.6)] -translate-x-1/2 mt-2 md:mt-0 dark:bg-[#050505]\" style=\"transform:scale(0)\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-right\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)\"><h4 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight\">Classe Préparatoire Intégrée (CPI) EISINe</h4><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue tracking-widest uppercase mb-6\">Université de Reims Champagne Ardenne (Charleville-Mézières)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg max-w-lg\">Formation scientifique exigeante avec un socle solide en mathématiques, physique, informatique, chimie et sciences de l&#x27;ingénieur.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 md:gap-16 w-full md:flex-row\"><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-16 sm:pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-right\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-50px)\"><h3 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[6rem] font-black text-transparent outline-none tracking-tighter\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px currentColor;color:transparent\"><span class=\"text-zinc-900/20 dark:text-white/20 select-none\">2021</span><span class=\"block text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-600 sm:inline-block sm:ml-4\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:0px\">- <!-- -->2022</span></h3></div><div class=\"absolute left-8 md:left-1/2 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 border-2 border-brand-blue shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(138,180,248,0.6)] -translate-x-1/2 mt-2 md:mt-0 dark:bg-[#050505]\" style=\"transform:scale(0)\"></div><div class=\"flex-1 w-full pl-20 md:pl-0 md:text-left\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px)\"><h4 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 mb-3 leading-tight tracking-tight\">Baccalauréat Scientifique</h4><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue tracking-widest uppercase mb-6\">COSACOM (Yaoundé, Cameroun)</p><p class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg max-w-lg\">Obtention du socle scientifique fondamental.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"relative h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-blue/50 to-transparent dark:via-brand-blue/30\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-[150px] bg-brand-blue blur-[2px]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[4px] w-[50px] bg-white blur-[4px] dark:bg-brand-blue/80\"></div></div><section id=\"experience\" class=\"relative w-full py-24 lg:py-32 scroll-mt-32\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02] dark:opacity-[0.03]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(128,128,128,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(128,128,128,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:40px 40px\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex flex-col items-start border-b border-black/10 pb-6 dark:border-white/10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\">System.Process.Monitor</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Expérience Professionnelle</h2><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">&gt; Chargement des données historiques...</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><button class=\"\n                    relative z-10 flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-4 border-l-[3px] bg-black/[0.01] px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 \n                    text-left transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-black/[0.03] \n                    dark:bg-white/[0.01] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\n                    backdrop-blur-sm\n                    border-emerald-500\n                  \"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[1px] bg-emerald-500 opacity-0 shadow-[0_0_15px_2px_rgba(16,185,129,0.5)] transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">[<!-- -->Depuis Octobre 2025<!-- -->]</span><div class=\"\n                        flex items-center gap-2 rounded border px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest\n                        border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\n                      \"><span class=\"relative flex h-2 w-2 items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span><span class=\"relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span></span>EN COURS</div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-blue dark:text-zinc-100 dark:group-hover:text-brand-blue sm:text-2xl\">Ingénieur Apprenti en Automatisme et Informatique Industrielle</h3><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network h-3.5 w-3.5 text-zinc-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">@ <!-- -->Minakem Dunkerque</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] text-zinc-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-black/10 group-hover:bg-black/[0.04] group-hover:text-zinc-900 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02] dark:group-hover:border-white/10 dark:group-hover:bg-white/[0.04] dark:group-hover:text-white sm:mt-0\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:auto;opacity:1\"><div class=\"\n                        border-l-[3px] px-4 py-6 sm:px-8 sm:py-8 backdrop-blur-md\n                        border-emerald-500/50 bg-emerald-500/[0.02] dark:bg-emerald-500/[0.01]\n                      \"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-4 w-4 text-zinc-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><h4 class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500\">Développement &amp; Intégration d&#x27;une Supervision Industrielle Multi-Systèmes (SCADA)</h4></div><ul class=\"space-y-3 border-l-2 border-black/10 pl-4 dark:border-white/10\"><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>Modélisation orientée objet (UDT Ignition) des équipements, permettant le déploiement d&#x27;un nouveau bâtiment par simple glisser-déposer, gain de temps de développement majeur.</li><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>Traçabilité réglementaire (Audit Trail) : chaque action opérateur enregistrée automatiquement (login, IP de session, horodatage) dans une base SQL, garantissant une traçabilité nominative fiable à 100%.</li><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>Gestion d&#x27;alarmes multi-niveaux selon la norme ISA-18.2 (Critique / Haute / Moyenne / Basse / Diagnostic), avec workflow d&#x27;acquittement basé sur les rôles. Les alarmes critiques ne sont acquittables que par un administrateur.</li><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>Interfaçage SQL Server via requêtes nommées et procédures stockées pour l&#x27;historisation et l&#x27;analyse des alarmes.</li><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>Dashboard analytique (ApexCharts) : heatmap fréquence/durée des pannes, répartition horaire des défauts, analyse Pareto, pensé pour réduire la charge cognitive des opérateurs en salle de contrôle.</li><li class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"mr-2 text-emerald-500 font-bold\">›</span>IHM responsive, adaptée aux écrans de salle de contrôle comme aux tablettes de terrain.</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-4 w-4 text-zinc-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><h4 class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-zinc-500\">Sys.Tech_Stack</h4></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">Automatisme</span><span class=\"rounded border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">Informatique Industrielle</span><span class=\"rounded border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">MS SQL Server (T-SQL)</span><span class=\"rounded border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">Ignition SCADA</span><span class=\"rounded border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.03] px-2.5 py-1 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700 transition-colors hover:bg-black/[0.05] dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.03] dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.05]\">Python</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-black/5 to-transparent dark:via-white/5\"></div></div><div class=\"group relative flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><button class=\"\n                    relative z-10 flex w-full flex-col items-start gap-4 border-l-[3px] bg-black/[0.01] px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 sm:py-6 \n                    text-left transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-black/[0.03] \n                    dark:bg-white/[0.01] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\n                    \n                    border-zinc-300 dark:border-zinc-700\n                  \"><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">[<!-- -->Depuis février 2024<!-- -->]</span><div class=\"\n                        flex items-center gap-2 rounded border px-2 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest\n                        border-zinc-400/30 bg-zinc-400/10 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\n                      \"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>TERMINÉ</div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-brand-blue dark:text-zinc-100 dark:group-hover:text-brand-blue sm:text-2xl\">Assistant Vente Drive</h3><div class=\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network h-3.5 w-3.5 text-zinc-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><p class=\"font-mono text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">@ <!-- -->Carrefour (Charleville-Mézières)</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-4 flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] text-zinc-400 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:border-black/10 group-hover:bg-black/[0.04] group-hover:text-zinc-900 dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02] dark:group-hover:border-white/10 dark:group-hover:bg-white/[0.04] dark:group-hover:text-white sm:mt-0\"><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></div></button><div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-black/5 to-transparent dark:via-white/5\"></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"relative h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-blue/50 to-transparent dark:via-brand-blue/30\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-[150px] bg-brand-blue blur-[2px]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[4px] w-[50px] bg-white blur-[4px] dark:bg-brand-blue/80\"></div></div><section id=\"projects\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden pb-32 pt-32 scroll-mt-32\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-20 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#8080800a_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#8080800a_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:64px_64px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_100%_at_50%_0%,#000_10%,transparent_110%)] md:bg-[size:100px_100px]\"></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-40 -z-10 -translate-x-1/2 select-none opacity-[0.03] dark:opacity-[0.02]\"><h2 class=\"text-[15vw] font-black tracking-[0.2em] text-transparent outline-none\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:2px currentColor;color:black\"><span class=\"dark:hidden\">ENGINEER</span></h2><h2 class=\"absolute inset-0 hidden text-[15vw] font-black tracking-[0.2em] text-transparent outline-none dark:block\" style=\"-webkit-text-stroke:2px white\">ENGINEER</h2></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex w-full flex-col items-start border-b border-black/10 pb-6 dark:border-white/10 lg:mb-20\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\">System.Process.Monitor</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Mes Projets</h2><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">&gt; 12 modules logiciels et matériels conçus du sol au plafond.</p></div><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-900 text-white shadow-md dark:bg-white dark:text-zinc-900\">Tous</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Automatisme &amp; Régulation</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Électronique</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Algorithmique</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Informatique Bas Niveau</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Systèmes Embarqués</button><button class=\"rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 hover:bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-400 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-white\">Développement Logiciel</button></div><div class=\"grid w-full auto-rows-[380px] grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 lg:auto-rows-[420px]\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2 md:row-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:scale(0.9)\"><div class=\"group relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-zinc-300 dark:border-white/10 bg-zinc-100/60 dark:bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-100/90 dark:hover:bg-zinc-900/80 p-8 lg:p-12 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-500 will-change-transform\" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:none\"><img alt=\"Contrôle-Commande Temps Réel, Procédé Hydraulique Bicuve\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover z-0 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/image/projects/controle-hydraulique-cover.webp\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/60 to-black/30 dark:from-black/95 dark:via-black/70 dark:to-black/40 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-[5px] group-hover:shadow-lg z-[2]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(99,102,241), transparent);opacity:0.4;box-shadow:none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-between text-white\" style=\"transform:translateZ(30px)\"><div><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-white/80\">2026</span><span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">3<!-- --> Mod. · <!-- -->Automatisme &amp; Régulation</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight md:text-xl text-white drop-shadow-lg\">Contrôle-Commande Temps Réel, Procédé Hydraulique Bicuve</h3><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80\">De la modélisation Matlab/Simulink au pilotage temps réel sur cible industrielle Speedgoat.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\" style=\"color:rgb(99, 102, 241)\">Temps de réponse divisé par 4 en boucle fermée, erreur statique annulée et robustesse de régulation validée sur banc d&#x27;essai matériel.</p></div><div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">Matlab/Simulink</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">Régulation P/PI/PID/Cascade</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">HIL Speedgoat</span></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-white\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-1 md:row-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:scale(0.9)\"><div class=\"group relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-black/[0.02] dark:bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-black/[0.04] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.04] p-8 md:p-10 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-500 will-change-transform\" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:none\"><img alt=\"Filtre Passe-Bas Actif de Tchebychev\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover z-0 transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/image/projects/filtre-tchebychev-cover.webp\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black/90 via-black/60 to-black/30 dark:from-black/95 dark:via-black/70 dark:to-black/40 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-[5px] group-hover:shadow-lg z-[2]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(6,182,212), transparent);opacity:0.4;box-shadow:none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-between text-white\" style=\"transform:translateZ(30px)\"><div><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-white/80\">2026</span><span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">4<!-- --> Mod. · <!-- -->Électronique</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight md:text-xl text-white drop-shadow-lg\">Filtre Passe-Bas Actif de Tchebychev</h3><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/80\">De l&#x27;équation à la carte électronique fonctionnelle, conception, simulation et fabrication d&#x27;un filtre analogique.</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\" style=\"color:rgb(6, 182, 212)\">Prototype matériel entièrement fonctionnel, respectant strictement la fréquence de coupure à 4,5 kHz avec une atténuation effective de 35dB mesurée à l&#x27;oscilloscope.</p></div><div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">LTSpice</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">KiCad</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">Cellules Sallen-Key</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-white/20 bg-white/10 text-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm\">Gravure CNC</span></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-white\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-1 md:row-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:scale(0.9)\"><div class=\"group relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-black/[0.02] dark:bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-black/[0.04] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.04] p-8 md:p-10 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-500 will-change-transfor