p class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\" style=\"color:rgb(122, 140, 74)\">Temps de traitement des cohortes de données mensuelles réduit significativement grâce à la vectorisation, avec restitution graphique quasi instantanée.</p></div><div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Python</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Analytique Data</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Scripts</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Vectorisation</span></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-black/5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-1 md:row-span-1\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(10px);transform:scale(0.9)\"><div class=\"group relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-black/5 dark:border-white/5 bg-black/[0.02] dark:bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-black/[0.04] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.04] p-8 md:p-10 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-500 will-change-transform\" style=\"transform-style:preserve-3d;transform:none\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-[5px] group-hover:shadow-lg z-[2]\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(93,101,168), transparent);opacity:0.4;box-shadow:none\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[2rem] transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 0%, rgba(93,101,168,0.06), transparent 60%);opacity:0\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-[0.03] mix-blend-overlay pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image:url(&#x27;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=&quot;0 0 200 200&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot;%3E%3Cfilter id=&quot;noiseFilter&quot;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&quot;fractalNoise&quot; baseFrequency=&quot;0.65&quot; numOctaves=&quot;3&quot; stitchTiles=&quot;stitch&quot;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&quot;100%25&quot; height=&quot;100%25&quot; filter=&quot;url(%23noiseFilter)&quot;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&#x27;)\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-6 bottom-20 h-14 w-14 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"color:rgb(93,101,168)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-full w-full\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"1\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"23\"></line><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"23\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"9\"></line><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"9\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"9\"></line><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"15\"></line></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-between \" style=\"transform:translateZ(30px)\"><div><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">2023</span><span class=\"rounded-full border px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-700 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-zinc-300\">5<!-- --> Mod. · <!-- -->Systèmes Embarqués</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-bold tracking-tight md:text-xl text-zinc-900 dark:text-white\">Robot Mobile Bluetooth</h3><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">Déploiement en tant que Chef de Projet d&#x27;un système matériel piloté via Arduino (C/C++).</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide\" style=\"color:rgb(93, 101, 168)\">Robot livré et fonctionnel en conditions réelles, avec chaîne motrice stabilisée contre les micro-coupures de tension et liaison Bluetooth bidirectionnelle fiable.</p></div><div class=\"mt-auto pt-8 flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">C/C++</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Arduino µC</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">CATIA V5</span><span class=\"rounded-md border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium border-black/10 bg-black/5 text-zinc-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-zinc-200\">Bluetooth RF</span></div><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-black/10 bg-black/5 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"relative h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-brand-blue/50 to-transparent dark:via-brand-blue/30\"><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-[150px] bg-brand-blue blur-[2px]\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[4px] w-[50px] bg-white blur-[4px] dark:bg-brand-blue/80\"></div></div><section id=\"skills\" class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden py-32 lg:py-40 scroll-mt-32\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] dark:opacity-[0.04]\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(128,128,128,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px),\n            linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(128,128,128,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px);background-size:60px 60px\"></div><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-6xl flex-col items-center px-4 relative z-10\"><div class=\"mb-16 flex w-full flex-col items-start border-b border-black/10 pb-6 dark:border-white/10 lg:mb-20\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\">System.Process.Monitor</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl\">Compétences Techniques</h2><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">&gt; Analyse des modules de compétences en cours...</p></div><div class=\"grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[280px_1fr] lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"flex flex-row gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-4 scrollbar-hide lg:flex-col lg:gap-3 lg:pb-0\" style=\"opacity:0\"><button class=\"group relative flex flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-left transition-all duration-300 lg:w-full bg-black/[0.04] dark:bg-white/[0.06]\" style=\"box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(16,185,129,0.2), 0 4px 12px rgba(16,185,129,0.08);opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-2 h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:rgb(16,185,129);opacity:1;box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(16,185,129,0.5)\"></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-900 dark:text-white\">Automatisme &amp; Supervision</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 hidden lg:block line-clamp-2\">Régulation industrielle, supervision SCADA &amp; automates</span></button><button class=\"group relative flex flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-left transition-all duration-300 lg:w-full hover:bg-black/[0.02] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-2 h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:rgb(59,130,246);opacity:0.3;box-shadow:none\"></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Développement Logiciel</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 hidden lg:block line-clamp-2\">Langages, architecture logicielle &amp; outils de développement</span></button><button class=\"group relative flex flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-left transi