ise en forme scientifique (LaTeX/Overleaf) pour la rédaction de comptes rendus et mémoires techniques, ainsi que la suite Office pour le reporting et la présentation de résultats.</span></button><button class=\"group relative flex flex-shrink-0 flex-col items-start rounded-2xl px-5 py-4 text-left transition-all duration-300 lg:w-full hover:bg-black/[0.02] dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\" style=\"opacity:0;filter:blur(8px);transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"mb-2 h-2 w-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:rgb(245,158,11);opacity:0.3;box-shadow:none\"></div><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Compétences Transversales</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500 hidden lg:block line-clamp-2\">Soft skills &amp; méthodologie</span></button></div><div class=\"relative min-h-[400px]\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-black/5 bg-black/[0.02] p-8 backdrop-blur-sm dark:border-white/5 dark:bg-white/[0.02] lg:p-10\" style=\"box-shadow:0 0 0 0.5px rgba(16,185,129,0.1), 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);opacity:0;filter:blur(6px);transform:translateY(15px)\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex items-center justify-between\"><div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white\">Automatisme &amp; Supervision</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400 line-clamp-2\">Régulation industrielle, supervision SCADA &amp; automates</p></div><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl\" style=\"background:rgba(16,185,129,0.1);color:rgb(16,185,129)\"><span class=\"text-lg font-bold\">8</span></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><div class=\"group flex flex-col gap-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" class=\"flex-shrink-0 text-zin